TASHKENTSPIRE2-TORPEDO.description:
At the end of the turn, deals damage to the enemy with the most [gold]Mark[/gold], with damage increased by the target's [gold]Mark[/gold].
The hit timing is determined by your [gold]Distance[/gold] when it is [gold]launched[/gold]:
By default, it hits the enemy at the end of the 3rd turn;
If your [gold]Distance[/gold] is [blue]2[/blue] or [blue]3[/blue], it hits the enemy at the end of the next turn;
If your [gold]Distance[/gold] is [blue]4[/blue] or [blue]5[/blue], it hits the enemy at the end of this turn.
